# Vectored delegated supervisor external interrupt from the controller.
# Host setup preloads:
# - privilege = User
# - controller source 1 enabled, routed to supervisor, and pending
# - mideleg/sie enable supervisor external interrupts
# - stvec = 0x20 in vectored mode
# Handler at 0x44 claims and completes source 1, records x10 = 9, and returns with sret.
# Expect x10 = 9, scause = interrupt 9, sepc = 0, privilege = User, pc = 0.
